{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Phase 2 evidence\n\nFrozen oracle: the existing emitted-verdict interface test was strengthened to require the canonical `codebase-verifiable` kind, the exact `[operator-attested]` tag, an external/repository distinction, and the statement that an untagged external criterion cannot be satisfied by a ticket comment alone. Negative controls remain: PASS emits no remediation; FAIL guidance never advertises force.\n\nRED: `pytest tests/interfaces/store/test_completion_verifier.py::test_fail_verdict_carries_remediation_guidance -q` collected/executed and failed at `assert \"[operator-attested]\" in guidance` against the old constant.\n\nHeld-out fix: fixer saw only the RCA and contract card; tests were removed/off-limits. It changed only `COMPLETION_REMEDIATION_GUIDANCE`. Review then corrected one vocabulary issue (`repository-verifiable` -> canonical `codebase-verifiable`) under the test-modification guard: fix removed, final oracle revised, RED re-proven, corrected fix reapplied.\n\nGREEN: `tests/interfaces/store/test_completion_verifier.py` => 23 passed. Defect-seeded mutation restoring the old guidance verbatim returned the held-out node to RED at the missing-tag assertion; restoring the fix returned it to GREEN. The oracle asserts emitted `verdict.remediation`, so behavior-preserving private refactors do not affect it.\n\nSafety/review: caller sweep found only `reconcile_verdict` plus deterministic/interface tests. No verdict logic, schemas, prompts, dependencies, security boundary, or performance path changed. Five-axis review found and resolved the one canonical-vocabulary issue; no remaining findings. No sibling construct/parity surface exists because every FAIL path converges through `reconcile_verdict`.\n\nGates: focused interface file 23 passed; `make lint` passed; `make typecheck` passed (438 source files); `make test` passed with 10,815 passed, 38 skipped, 228 deselected, 36 warnings in 2,183.62s. Ticket 8322 closed successfully without force after the tagged default verifier returned a certifiable PASS."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786072788731163001,"uuid":"9c3f667d-45a3-4695-aa25-f8870f60a622"}